abstract: >-
  Code and derived data that reproduce the estimates in the Master of Economics research report
  "Star Arrivals and Their Colleagues: Evidence from Australian Academia" (The University of
  Melbourne, 2026): 377 star arrivals at eleven Australian universities, 1999-2024. One command
  re-estimates 23 of the 27 headline estimates and checks the other 4 against their recorded runs.
  The table and figure generators also need the author's manuscript and working trees, which are not
  included; the numbers the report prints are. Code is MIT-licensed; derived data are CC BY 4.0
  (upstream OpenAlex data are CC0).
